            <description><![CDATA[<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li>See what changed in each version from Settings › Update: the new &quot;Release Notes&quot; row opens the public changelog in your browser.</li>
<li>Read the release notes for an update directly in the update window before installing it.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Note</h3>
<ul>
<li>Requires macOS 14.0 or later.</li>
<li>Updates from v1.0.30 and earlier still show no notes for the immediate next upgrade; release notes appear again from the version after that.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
